            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>截至台北時間20日09:24，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌18.28點（或6.41%），暫報267.05點。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li>近 1 週：-15.01%</li><li>近 1 月：-27.59%</li><li>近 3 月：-25.85%</li><li>近 6 月：-28.34%</li><li>今年以來：+3.29%</li></ul></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>焦點個股</em></p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>測試介面概念領跌-9.11%。其中    雍智科技(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6683:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6683\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6683-TW</a>)            下跌        9.99%            ;        健策(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3653:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3653\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3653-TW</a>)            下跌        9.96%            ;        中探針(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6217:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6217\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6217-TW</a>)            下跌        9.96%    。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>光通訊模組概念領跌-9.00%。其中    波若威(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3163:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3163\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3163-TW</a>)            下跌        10%            ;        聯鈞(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3450:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-sect